{
  "task_description": "{'component_name': 'Main Container for PetMemoryVault', 'description': 'Primary container for PetMemoryVault implementation: MyPetStory is a personalized online journal for pet owners to capture, organize, and share every special moment of their pet’s life. It allows users to add memories, photos, and milestones, and automatically compiles these into a printable scrapbook. The platform supports sharing the pet’s story via private or public links, making it easy to celebrate and preserve memories both digitally and physically.', 'interfaces': [], 'framework': 'react', 'platform': 'web', 'container': '{\n  "name": "PetMemoryVault-35582 frontend Container",\n  "features": [\n    {\n      "name": "Add Memory",\n      "description": "Allows users to add memories with text and photos, which are displayed in the timeline and updated in the scrapbook.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Timeline",\n      "description": "Chronological view of all added memories, with the ability to add new memories directly from this page.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Photos",\n      "description": "Dedicated page to upload and view all pet photos. Uploaded photos are automatically included in the scrapbook.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Milestones",\n      "description": "Page to add and view important milestones in the pet\\u2019s life. All milestones are updated in the scrapbook.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Scrapbook",\n      "description": "A digital scrapbook that automatically compiles all uploaded photos and milestones, allowing users to add descriptions. It is printable and always up-to-date with user inputs.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Shareable Story Timeline",\n      "description": "Enables users to share their pet\\u2019s journey with family and friends via private or public links.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Pet Profile Image",\n      "description": "Home page allows users to upload their pet\\u2019s image as a profile picture, replacing any default or example images.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    }\n  ],\n  "techStack": {\n    "frontend": [\n      "React JS"\n    ],\n    "backend": [\n      "None"\n    ],\n    "language": [\n      "JavaScript (ES6+)"\n    ]\n  },\n  "colors": {\n    "primary": "#F7C59F",\n    "secondary": "#A1C6EA",\n    "accent": "#F67280"\n  },\n  "theme": "light",\n  "layoutDescription": "The home page features a beautiful paw image and allows users to upload their pet\\u2019s profile photo. Navigation includes Timeline (with add memory option), Photos (for uploading and viewing), Milestones (for adding/viewing milestones), and Scrapbook (auto-updated with all photos and milestones, with editable descriptions). The Share option is accessible from the scrapbook and timeline. No example or default pet memories are shown. All user inputs are reflected in the scrapbook automatically."\n}'}",
